<title>USA: Belden completes Alpha Wire Division assets.</title>
<headline>Belden completes Alpha Wire Division assets.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belden Inc said Wednesday it completed its previously announced acquisition of the assets of Alpha Wire Division of Alpha Wire Corp.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Alpha produces and markets specialty wire and cable and had 1996 revenues of about $51 million.</p>
<p>Belden designs, manufactures and markets wire, cable and cord products for electronic and electrical markets.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
